mod-tiers.tsv is generated by packaging/data/generate_mod_tiers.py from two sources.

Its mod families, their tiers and the item level each tier needs are Path of Exile 2's own data:
the game's mod and base item tables (mods.json and base_items.json) as exported by RePoE for PoE2
version 4.5.5.2 at https://repoe-fork.github.io/poe2/ (https://github.com/repoe-fork/repoe-fork).
That data is owned by Grinding Gear Games. RePoE's code is distributed under the MIT License, and
its license adds: "Contents of generated files (all files in the `data` directory) are owned by
Grinding Gear Games and shall not be used or published without being in accordance with their
terms of use."

